      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAKE THE ZIPPER (1) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish seventh (24.13) at this track over 400m. Drops down the inside box this time. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. PRINCESS DOCKER (2) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 4 lengths (17.33) at Taree Super Track in a Maiden over 300m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Bold showing expected. REBORN PULSE (8) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (23.46) at this track in a Maiden over 400m. Expected to be in this for a long way. MY PARTY PIE (6) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
